  "content": "<p>建造苦力怕農場遇到困難嗎？還是你更喜歡冒險？</p><p>這個模組就是為你準備的！</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>這個模組新增了火藥的合成配方 :)</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>歡迎參觀我的其他模組：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/brewing-stand-mk-ii\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">釀造台 Mk.II</a>（全新！）&nbsp;</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/remote-control-card\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">遙控卡</a>（全新！）&nbsp;</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/potion-of-thunder\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">雷霆藥水</a>（全新！）&nbsp;</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sunny-wand\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">晴天魔杖</a>（全新！）&nbsp;</li>\n</ul><p>&nbsp;</p><ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/block-compressor-0-1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">方塊壓縮機</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/tnt-ultra\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">終極TNT</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/auto-planting\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">自動種植</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/signal-block\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">訊號方塊</a></li>\n<li>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/inventory-display\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">物品欄顯示</a></li>\n<li>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/easy-netherstar-recipe\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">簡易地獄之星合成</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/allien-fusion-generator\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">異界融合發電機</a>（適用於Mekanism等）&nbsp;</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/easy-netherite-plus\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">簡易獄髓Plus</a>&nbsp;</li>\n</ul>",
